            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Access</strong> Tian Xia origin</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You would take damage.</p><hr /><p>Your armor has a retractable spike-covered shell reminiscent of Hwanggot's heavily armored geobukseon, or \"turtle ships.\" The shell unfolds across your body, giving you a +4 circumstance bonus to AC and resistance 2 to bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing damage until the end of your next turn. Spiked chains propelled by small bursts of black powder also erupt from the shell, dealing @Damage[3d4[piercing],2[persistent,fire]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[reflex|against:inventor|basic] save against your class DC) to all creatures in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:5].</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 10
          },
          "prerequisites": {
